   — Adoption accelerating in markets with medically literate patients
   — Houston and Boston showing strongest growth signals

4. Emface (BTL)
   — New category interest high across all markets
   — Investment hesitation tied to patient education requirement

5. RHA Collection (Revance)
   — Dynamic filler conversation strongest in NY and SF
   — Expression-focused patient driving adoption

